{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../agent/", "title": "Agents"}, "next": {"link": "../plugins/", "title": "Plugins"}, "title": "Orchestrator", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"orchestrator\">\n<h1>Orchestrator<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#orchestrator\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<section id=\"module-PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator\">\n<span id=\"pyorchestrate-core-orchestrator-orchestrator\"></span><h2>PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.RunMode\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">RunMode</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">value</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">names=&lt;not</span> <span class=\"pre\">given&gt;</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">*values</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">module=None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">qualname=None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">type=None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">start=1</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">boundary=None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.RunMode\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/enum.html#enum.Enum\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Enum</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Execution mode for the Orchestrator main loop.</p>\n<p><strong>When to use STOP_ON_EMPTY:</strong>\n- Batch processing jobs with defined end\n- ETL pipelines\n- One-time data migrations\n- Testing scenarios</p>\n<p><strong>When to use DAEMON:</strong>\n- Web servers and APIs\n- Continuous monitoring systems\n- Event-driven architectures\n- Long-running services requiring CLI control</p>\n<p><strong>Important:</strong> DAEMON mode requires explicit shutdown via CLI\ncommand \u2018shutdown\u2019 or programmatic call to stop().</p>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.RunMode.STOP_ON_EMPTY\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">STOP_ON_EMPTY</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'stop_on_empty'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.RunMode.STOP_ON_EMPTY\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Stop when all agents finished</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.RunMode.DAEMON\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">DAEMON</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'daemon'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.RunMode.DAEMON\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Keep running until explicitly shutdown</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">OrchestratorConfig</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">check_interval</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">max_workers</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_start_timeout</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_stop_timeout</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">enable_command_interface</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">command_zmq_address</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">allowed_commands</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">run_mode</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">history_max_events</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">history_payload_bytes</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../base/#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.base.BaseClassConfig\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseClassConfig</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Orchestrator configuration class.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Variables<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>check_interval</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>float</em></a>) \u2013 The interval to check the agents. Defaults to 1.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>max_workers</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>) \u2013 The maximum number of workers that can run concurrently. Defaults to 5.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>agent_start_timeout</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>float</em></a>) \u2013 Maximum time in seconds to wait for an agent to start. Defaults to 30.0.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>agent_stop_timeout</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>float</em></a>) \u2013 Maximum time in seconds to wait for agents to terminate during shutdown. Defaults to 10.0.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>enable_command_interface</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>) \u2013 Enable external command interface via ZeroMQ over TCP. Defaults to True.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>command_zmq_address</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>) \u2013 ZeroMQ address for external commands. Defaults to <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">&quot;tcp://*:5555&quot;</span></code>.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>logger</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../base/#PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.utilities.LoggerConfig\"><em>LoggerConfig</em></a>) \u2013 Logger configuration.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>run_mode</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.RunMode\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.RunMode\"><em>RunMode</em></a>) \u2013 Required lifecycle policy. Defaults to RunMode.STOP_ON_EMPTY.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>history_max_events</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>) \u2013 Maximum number of events to store in history (ring buffer size). Defaults to 5000.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>history_payload_bytes</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>) \u2013 Maximum size for event payload data. Defaults to 256.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>check_interval</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>float</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>max_workers</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>agent_start_timeout</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>float</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>agent_stop_timeout</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>float</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>enable_command_interface</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>bool</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>command_zmq_address</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>allowed_commands</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#set\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>set</em></a><em>[</em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em>] </em><em>| </em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>run_mode</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.RunMode\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.RunMode\"><em>RunMode</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>history_max_events</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>history_payload_bytes</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.check_interval\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">check_interval</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">float</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">1</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.check_interval\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The interval to check the agents.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.max_workers\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">max_workers</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">5</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.max_workers\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The maximum number of workers that can run concurrently.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.agent_start_timeout\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_start_timeout</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">float</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">30.0</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.agent_start_timeout\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Maximum time in seconds to wait for an agent to start. Defaults to 30.0.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.agent_stop_timeout\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_stop_timeout</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">float</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">10.0</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.agent_stop_timeout\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Maximum time in seconds to wait for agents to terminate during shutdown.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.enable_command_interface\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">enable_command_interface</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">True</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.enable_command_interface\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Enable external command interface via ZeroMQ.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.command_zmq_address\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">command_zmq_address</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'tcp://*:5555'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.command_zmq_address\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>ZeroMQ address for external commands.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.allowed_commands\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">allowed_commands</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#set\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">set</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.allowed_commands\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Allowed commands for CLI interface. Can be a set of commands, a preset name, or None for all commands.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.run_mode\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">run_mode</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.RunMode\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.RunMode\"><span class=\"pre\">RunMode</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'stop_on_empty'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.run_mode\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Execution mode for the orchestrator. Defaults to RunMode.STOP_ON_EMPTY.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.history_max_events\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">history_max_events</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">5000</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.history_max_events\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Maximum number of events to store in history (ring buffer size).</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.history_payload_bytes\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">history_payload_bytes</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">256</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.history_payload_bytes\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Maximum size for event payload data.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.validate\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">validate</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig.validate\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Override this method to implement custom validation logic in derived classes.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>List of validation results.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>List[<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../utilities/#PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ValidationResult\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.validation.ValidationResult\">ValidationResult</a>]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorPlugin\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">OrchestratorPlugin</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorPlugin\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../base/#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassPlugin\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.base.BaseClassPlugin\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseClassPlugin</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Plugin class for the Orchestrator.</p>\n<p>This class can contain various plugins that extend orchestrator functionality.</p>\n<p>Plugins can be defined as class attributes (defaults) and overridden via constructor:</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Example</p>\n<dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>class MyOrchestratorPlugin(OrchestratorPlugin):</dt><dd><p>custom_plugin = CustomPlugin()</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p># Use default\nplugin1 = MyOrchestratorPlugin()</p>\n<p># Override heartbeat\nplugin2 = MyOrchestratorPlugin(heartbeat=OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin())</p>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorPlugin.heartbeat\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">heartbeat</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../plugins/#PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.plugins.heartbeat.OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin\"><span class=\"pre\">OrchestratorHeartbeatPlugin</span></a><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorPlugin.heartbeat\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">Orchestrator</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">config</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">plugin</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../base/#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClass\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.base.BaseClass\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">BaseClass</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Orchestrator class to manages the agents.</p>\n<p>The Orchestrator provides centralized event management and coordination for all agents.\nAgents communicate with the orchestrator via message channels, and the orchestrator\nhandles all event processing and callback execution through its own event manager.</p>\n<p>This centralized approach eliminates event duplication and provides a single point\nof control for system-wide event handling.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Variables<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>memory</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.OMemory\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.OMemory\"><em>OMemory</em></a>) \u2013 Memory to store the agents.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>event_manager</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../utilities/#PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.event_manager.EventManager\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.event_manager.EventManager\"><em>EventManager</em></a>) \u2013 Centralized event manager for handling all agent events.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>dependencies</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>dict</em></a><em>[</em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em>, </em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#list\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>list</em></a><em>[</em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em>]</em><em>]</em>) \u2013 Dependencies among agents.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>config</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig\"><em>OrchestratorConfig</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>plugin</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorPlugin\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorPlugin\"><em>OrchestratorPlugin</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.Config\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">Config</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.Config\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>alias of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">OrchestratorConfig</span></code></a></p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.Plugin\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">Plugin</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.Plugin\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>alias of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorPlugin\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorPlugin\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">OrchestratorPlugin</span></code></a></p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.config\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">config</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorConfig\"><span class=\"pre\">OrchestratorConfig</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.config\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.plugin\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">plugin</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorPlugin\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.OrchestratorPlugin\"><span class=\"pre\">OrchestratorPlugin</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.plugin\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.start_time\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">start_time</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">float</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.start_time\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Set again by start(); initialized here so join() never reads it unset.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.register_agent\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">register_agent</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_class</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">custom_config</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">custom_plugin</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">control_events</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">state_events</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">msg_channel</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.register_agent\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Register an agent on the orchestrator.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>After registering the agent, you can call the <cite>start</cite> method to start all agents.</p>\n<p>Events from agents are handled centrally by the orchestrator\u2019s event manager.\nAgents communicate with the orchestrator via message channel.</p>\n<p>Delegates to AgentLifecycleManager.</p>\n<div class=\"admonition warning\">\n<p class=\"admonition-title\">Warning</p>\n<p>agent_name must be unique.</p>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>agent_class</strong> \u2013 Class of the agent to register.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>) \u2013 Name of the agent.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>custom_config</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../base/#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.base.BaseClassConfig\"><em>BaseClassConfig</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>) \u2013 Custom configuration for the agent.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>custom_plugin</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../base/#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassPlugin\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.base.BaseClassPlugin\"><em>BaseClassPlugin</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>) \u2013 Custom plugin for the agent.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>control_events</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../agent/#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.ControlEvents\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.ControlEvents\"><em>ControlEvents</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>) \u2013 Control events for the agent.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>state_events</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../agent/#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.StateEvents\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.StateEvents\"><em>StateEvents</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>) \u2013 State events for the agent.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>msg_channel</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../utilities/#PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.messaging.MessageChannel\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.messaging.MessageChannel\"><em>MessageChannel</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>) \u2013 Message channel for the agent.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>kwargs</strong> \u2013 Additional arguments for the agent.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>The agent entry object stored in the memory.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.AgentEntry\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.AgentEntry\">AgentEntry</a></p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/exceptions.html#ValueError\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><strong>ValueError</strong></a> \u2013 If an agent with the same name is already registered.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/exceptions.html#Exception\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><strong>Exception</strong></a> \u2013 If agent registration fails for any reason.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.register_event\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">register_event</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">event_type</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">callback</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.register_event\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Register a callback function for a specific event type.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>event_type</strong> \u2013 The type of event to listen for (e.g., OrchestratorEvent.AGENT_STARTED).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>callback</strong> \u2013 The callback function to execute when the event occurs.\nThe callback will receive the event data as arguments.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Example</p>\n<p>orchestrator.register_event(OrchestratorEvent.AGENT_STARTED, on_agent_start)\norchestrator.register_event(OrchestratorEvent.AGENT_TERMINATED, on_agent_terminated)</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.add_dependency\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">add_dependency</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_name</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">depends_on</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.add_dependency\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Add dependencies: agent_name depends on depends_on.</p>\n<p>Validation is performed during validate_dependencies() call.\nDelegates entirely to DependencyGraph.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>agent_name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>) \u2013 Name of the agent that has dependencies</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>depends_on</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#list\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>list</em></a><em>[</em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em>]</em>) \u2013 List of agent names that agent_name depends on</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.validate_dependencies\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">validate_dependencies</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.validate_dependencies\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Validate dependency graph for errors (cycles, missing agents).</p>\n<p>Delegates entirely to DependencyGraph.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/exceptions.html#ValueError\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><strong>ValueError</strong></a> \u2013 If validation fails (cycles or unregistered agents)</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.start\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">start</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.start\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Start all registered agents in the topological order of their dependencies.</p>\n<p>Delegates to WorkerPoolScheduler for agent startup.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.stop\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">stop</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.stop\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Terminates all registered agents and ends a running <cite>join()</cite>.</p>\n<p>Cancels queued starts and delegates running-agent stops to\nAgentLifecycleManager through WorkerPoolScheduler.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>The worker pool stops accepting new starts, so this is a one-way\ntransition. It also raises the shutdown flag, which is what makes\n<cite>RunMode.DAEMON</cite> honour the programmatic stop its documentation\npromises: without it a <cite>join()</cite> running in another thread waited\nforever for the CLI <cite>shutdown</cite> command.</p>\n<p>This method only requests termination. Use <cite>shutdown()</cite> to wait for\nthe agents and release the orchestrator\u2019s own resources, or let\n<cite>join()</cite> do it when its loop exits.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.shutdown\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">shutdown</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">timeout</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.shutdown\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Stop every agent and release everything the orchestrator owns.</p>\n<p>This is the teardown half of <cite>join()</cite>, callable on its own for an\norchestrator that is not being driven by the main join loop \u2014 an inner\norchestrator inside a <cite>PoolAgent</cite>, for instance.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>Agents are stopped and joined first: they must be gone before the\nmessage router and the plugins are torn down, otherwise they keep\nrunning against closed channels. A process agent that ignores the\ncooperative stop is force-terminated; a thread agent that ignores it\ncannot be, so it is quarantined and reported.</p>\n<p>Then the channel handlers are stopped, the plugins finalized, the\nevent bus shut down and the agent message channel closed. Skipping\nthe last two left an executor thread and a queue feeder thread per\norchestrator alive for the life of the process.</p>\n<p>Calling this more than once is a no-op.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>timeout</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>float</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>) \u2013 Budget in seconds for the cooperative wait, shared by all\nagents. Defaults to <cite>Config.agent_stop_timeout</cite>.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>Names of the agents still alive afterwards.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>List[<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">str</a>]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.join\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">join</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.join\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Check the status of all agents and wait for them to complete.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>This method blocks the current thread until all agents are terminated.</p>\n<p>If command interface is enabled, the orchestrator will continue running\neven after all agents have finished, allowing remote control via CLI.\nUse the \u2018shutdown\u2019 command to terminate the orchestrator in this mode.</p>\n<ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p>When agent is terminated, it emits an <cite>OrchestratorEvent.AGENT_TERMINATED</cite> event.</p></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Uses WorkerPoolScheduler to manage agent termination and queue.</p>\n<p>Once the loop exits, every agent is stopped and joined within\n<cite>agent_stop_timeout</cite> before channel handlers and plugins are shut\ndown. A process agent that ignores the cooperative stop request is\nforce-terminated; a thread agent that ignores it cannot be, so it\nis quarantined and reported.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.reap_terminated_agents\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">reap_terminated_agents</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.reap_terminated_agents\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Release the worker slot of every agent that has finished.</p>\n<p>One pass of what the <cite>join()</cite> loop does on each tick: an agent that is\nno longer alive gives its slot back to the scheduler, which starts the\nnext queued agent, and its generation is marked terminated so late\nmessages from it are ignored.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>A driver other than <cite>join()</cite> has to call this itself. <cite>PoolAgent</cite>\ndoes it from <cite>runner()</cite>: without it, nothing released the inner\nscheduler\u2019s slots, so a pool holding more agents than <cite>max_workers</cite>\nnever started the ones left in the queue.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.simple_join\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">simple_join</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.simple_join\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Simple join method to wait for all processes or threads to complete their execution.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.report\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">report</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.orchestrator.Orchestrator.report\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Report the status of all agents.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager\">\n<span id=\"pyorchestrate-core-orchestrator-lifecycle-manager\"></span><h2>PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<p>Agent lifecycle management for registration, startup, and termination.</p>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartStatus\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">LifecycleStartStatus</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">value</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">names=&lt;not</span> <span class=\"pre\">given&gt;</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">*values</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">module=None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">qualname=None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">type=None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">start=1</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">boundary=None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartStatus\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/enum.html#enum.Enum\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Enum</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Outcome of one authoritative lifecycle startup attempt.</p>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartStatus.STARTED\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">STARTED</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'started'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartStatus.STARTED\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartStatus.CANCELLED\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">CANCELLED</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'cancelled'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartStatus.CANCELLED\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartStatus.FAILED_CLEAN\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">FAILED_CLEAN</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'failed_clean'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartStatus.FAILED_CLEAN\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartStatus.FAILED_LIVE\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">FAILED_LIVE</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'failed_live'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartStatus.FAILED_LIVE\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartResult\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">LifecycleStartResult</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">status</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">reason</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartResult\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#object\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">object</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Typed result returned by <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.start_agent\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.start_agent\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">AgentLifecycleManager.start_agent()</span></code></a>.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>status</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartStatus\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartStatus\"><em>LifecycleStartStatus</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>reason</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartResult.status\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">status</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartStatus\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartStatus\"><span class=\"pre\">LifecycleStartStatus</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartResult.status\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartResult.reason\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">reason</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></em><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartResult.reason\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py property\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartResult.started\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">property</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">started</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartResult.started\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py property\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartResult.live_failure\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">property</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">live_failure</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartResult.live_failure\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">AgentLifecycleManager</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">memory</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">config</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">logger</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">before_start</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#object\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">object</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Authoritative owner of agent lifecycle state transitions.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>memory</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.OMemory\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.OMemory\"><em>OMemory</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>config</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../base/#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.base.BaseClassConfig\"><em>BaseClassConfig</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>before_start</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/collections.abc.html#collections.abc.Callable\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>Callable</em></a><em>[</em><em>[</em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em>, </em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>int</em></a><em>]</em><em>, </em><em>None</em><em>] </em><em>| </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.register_agent\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">register_agent</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_class</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">name</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">custom_config</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">custom_plugin</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">control_events</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">state_events</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">msg_channel</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.register_agent\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Register an agent without creating its concrete instance.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>agent_class</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#type\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>type</em></a><em>[</em><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../agent/#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentProtocol\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.AgentProtocol\"><em>AgentProtocol</em></a><em>]</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>custom_config</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../base/#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassConfig\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.base.BaseClassConfig\"><em>BaseClassConfig</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>custom_plugin</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../base/#PyOrchestrate.core.base.BaseClassPlugin\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.base.base.BaseClassPlugin\"><em>BaseClassPlugin</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>control_events</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../agent/#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.ControlEvents\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.ControlEvents\"><em>ControlEvents</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>state_events</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../agent/#PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.StateEvents\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.agent.base_agent.BaseAgent.StateEvents\"><em>StateEvents</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>msg_channel</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../utilities/#PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.messaging.MessageChannel\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.utilities.messaging.MessageChannel\"><em>MessageChannel</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.AgentEntry\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.AgentEntry\"><em>AgentEntry</em></a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.prepare_start\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">prepare_start</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_name</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.prepare_start\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Prepare a non-blocking startup attempt for scheduler ownership.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>agent_name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.AgentStartAttempt\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.AgentStartAttempt\"><em>AgentStartAttempt</em></a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.execute_start\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">execute_start</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_name</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">attempt</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.execute_start\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Create and start one prepared generation with bounded acknowledgement.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>agent_name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>attempt</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.AgentStartAttempt\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.AgentStartAttempt\"><em>AgentStartAttempt</em></a>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartResult\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartResult\"><em>LifecycleStartResult</em></a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.start_agent\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">start_agent</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_name</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.start_agent\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Prepare and execute a fresh generation without scheduler accounting.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>agent_name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartResult\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartResult\"><em>LifecycleStartResult</em></a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.restart_agent\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">restart_agent</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_name</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.restart_agent\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Restart through the same guarded startup path as a first start.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>agent_name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartResult\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.LifecycleStartResult\"><em>LifecycleStartResult</em></a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.stop_agent\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">stop_agent</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_name</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.stop_agent\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Cancel startup or request stop without waiting on another agent.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>agent_name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.stop_all\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">stop_all</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.stop_all\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Request stop for every registered agent.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.shutdown_all\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">shutdown_all</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">timeout</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.shutdown_all\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Stop every agent, wait for termination, and escalate on survivors.</p>\n<p>Unlike <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.stop_all\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.stop_all\"><code class=\"xref py py-meth docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">stop_all()</span></code></a>, which only requests cooperative termination,\nthis is the blocking path used when the orchestrator itself is going\ndown: agents must be gone before channels and plugins are torn down.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>timeout</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>float</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>) \u2013 Overall budget in seconds for the cooperative wait. The\nbudget is shared by all agents. <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></code> waits indefinitely.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>Names of the agents that are still alive afterwards.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#list\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">list</a>[<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">str</a>]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.join_agent\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">join_agent</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_name</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">timeout</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.join_agent\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Join an initialized concrete instance through lifecycle ownership.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>agent_name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>timeout</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#float\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>float</em></a><em> | </em><em>None</em>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.is_attempt_alive\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">is_attempt_alive</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_name</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">attempt</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.is_attempt_alive\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Return whether the instance owned by <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">attempt</span></code> remains alive.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>agent_name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>attempt</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.AgentStartAttempt\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.AgentStartAttempt\"><em>AgentStartAttempt</em></a>)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">bool</a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.mark_terminated\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">mark_terminated</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_name</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.mark_terminated\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Record termination observed by the orchestrator.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>agent_name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.get_agent\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_agent</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_name</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.get_agent\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>agent_name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.AgentEntry\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.AgentEntry\"><em>AgentEntry</em></a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.get_all_agents\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_all_agents</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.lifecycle_manager.AgentLifecycleManager.get_all_agents\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#list\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">list</a>[<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.AgentEntry\" title=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.memory.AgentEntry\"><em>AgentEntry</em></a>]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.dependency_graph\">\n<span id=\"pyorchestrate-core-orchestrator-dependency-graph\"></span><h2>PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.dependency_graph<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.dependency_graph\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<p>Dependency graph management for agent dependencies.</p>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.dependency_graph.DependencyGraph\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.dependency_graph.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">DependencyGraph</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.dependency_graph.DependencyGraph\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#object\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">object</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Manages dependency relationships between agents.</p>\n<p>This class handles the dependency graph for agents, providing methods to:\n- Add dependencies between agents\n- Validate the graph for correctness (no cycles, valid nodes)\n- Compute topological sort order for agent startup</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Example</p>\n<div class=\"doctest highlight-default notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">graph</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">DependencyGraph</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">graph</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add_dependency</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"agent_a\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"agent_b\"</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">graph</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">validate</span><span class=\"p\">({</span><span class=\"s2\">\"agent_a\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"agent_b\"</span><span class=\"p\">})</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"n\">order</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">graph</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">topological_sort</span><span class=\"p\">({</span><span class=\"s2\">\"agent_a\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"agent_b\"</span><span class=\"p\">})</span>\n<span class=\"gp\">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span><span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">order</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>  <span class=\"c1\"># ['agent_b', 'agent_a']</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.dependency_graph.DependencyGraph.add_dependency\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">add_dependency</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_name</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">depends_on</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.dependency_graph.DependencyGraph.add_dependency\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Add dependency: agent_name depends on depends_on agents.</p>\n<p>Duplicate edges are ignored: declaring the same dependency twice (either\nby calling this method again or by repeating a name in <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">depends_on</span></code>)\nleaves the graph unchanged.</p>\n<p>An empty <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">depends_on</span></code> adds nothing: the agent would otherwise become a\nnode of the graph without having declared a single dependency.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>agent_name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>) \u2013 Name of the dependent agent</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>depends_on</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#list\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>list</em></a><em>[</em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em>]</em>) \u2013 List of agent names that must start before agent_name</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.dependency_graph.DependencyGraph.validate\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">validate</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">valid_agent_names</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.dependency_graph.DependencyGraph.validate\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Validate the dependency graph.</p>\n<p>Checks:\n1. All referenced agent names exist in valid_agent_names\n2. No circular dependencies exist</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>valid_agent_names</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#set\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>set</em></a><em>[</em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em>]</em>) \u2013 Set of all registered agent names</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/exceptions.html#ValueError\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><strong>ValueError</strong></a> \u2013 If validation fails (missing agents or cycles detected)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.dependency_graph.DependencyGraph.topological_sort\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">topological_sort</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_names</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.dependency_graph.DependencyGraph.topological_sort\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Compute topological ordering of agents respecting dependencies.</p>\n<p>Uses Kahn\u2019s algorithm (BFS) to compute the ordering.\nAgents with no dependencies come first, followed by their dependents.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Notes</p>\n<p>The graph is left untouched: sorting reads it through a local view of\nthe agents it was asked to order.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>agent_names</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#set\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>set</em></a><em>[</em><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a><em>]</em>) \u2013 Set of all agent names to order</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>Agents in topological order (dependencies before dependents)</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#list\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">list</a>[<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">str</a>]</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/exceptions.html#ValueError\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><strong>ValueError</strong></a> \u2013 If graph has not been validated or contains cycles</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.dependency_graph.DependencyGraph.get_dependencies\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_dependencies</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">agent_name</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.dependency_graph.DependencyGraph.get_dependencies\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get list of dependencies for a specific agent.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>agent_name</strong> (<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><em>str</em></a>) \u2013 Name of the agent</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>List of agent names this agent depends on</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#list\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">list</a>[<a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">str</a>]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.dependency_graph.DependencyGraph.has_dependencies\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">has_dependencies</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.dependency_graph.DependencyGraph.has_dependencies\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Check if any dependencies are defined.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>True if at least one dependency exists, False otherwise</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\">bool</a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.worker_pool\">\n<span id=\"pyorchestrate-core-orchestrator-worker-pool\"></span><h2>PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.worker_pool<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.worker_pool\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<p>Worker-pool capacity reservation and agent scheduling.</p>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.worker_pool.WorkerStartStatus\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.worker_pool.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">WorkerStartStatus</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">value</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">names=&lt;not</span> <span class=\"pre\">given&gt;</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">*values</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">module=None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">qualname=None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">type=None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">start=1</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">boundary=None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.worker_pool.WorkerStartStatus\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/enum.html#enum.Enum\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Enum</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Scheduler-level outcome of a start request.</p>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.worker_pool.WorkerStartStatus.STARTED\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">STARTED</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'started'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.worker_pool.WorkerStartStatus.STARTED\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.worker_pool.WorkerStartStatus.QUEUED\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">QUEUED</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'queued'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.worker_pool.WorkerStartStatus.QUEUED\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.worker_pool.WorkerStartStatus.CANCELLED\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">CANCELLED</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'cancelled'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.worker_pool.WorkerStartStatus.CANCELLED\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.worker_pool.WorkerStartStatus.FAILED_CLEAN\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">FAILED_CLEAN</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'failed_clean'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.worker_pool.WorkerStartStatus.FAILED_CLEAN\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.worker_pool.WorkerStartStatus.FAILED_LIVE\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">FAILED_LIVE</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'failed_live'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.worker_pool.WorkerStartStatus.FAILED_LIVE\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.worker_pool.WorkerStartResult\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.worker_pool.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">WorkerStartResult</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">status</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">reason</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.worker_pool.WorkerStartResult\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/functions.html#object\" title=\"(in Python v3.11)\"><code class=\"xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">object</span></code></a></p>\n<p>Typed scheduler result that preserves lifecycle failure semantics.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>status</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#PyOrchestrate.core.orchestrator.worker